<% content_for :title, "Welcome to Kara Bloome" %>

<h1 style="
  margin: 0 0 20px;
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #111827;
  text-align: center;
">
    Welcome to Kara Bloome!
</h1>

<p style="
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #374151;
  text-align: center;
">
    Hello <%= @user.first_name || @user.email %>,<br />
    Thank you for joining Kara Bloome!
</p>

<p style="
  margin: 0 0 20px;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #374151;
  text-align: center;
">
    We're excited to have you on board. Your account has been
    successfully created and you can now start exploring and
    shopping with us.
</p>

<p style="
  margin: 0 0 32px;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #374151;
  text-align: center;
">
    If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to
    reach out to our support team.
</p>

<p style="
  margin: 32px 0 0;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #6b7280;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.5;
">
    Best regards,<br />
    The Kara Bloome Team
</p>
